layer tanks lose one health pip per hit (shields still block).\nFireballs still push the soccer balls around without exploding on them.\nAll levels are available from the start, with no qualifiers required.\nThe Shield, Speed Boost, Fast Gun and Health powerups can be picked up again.\nShooting a powerup or ammo crate destroys it. Ammo crates respawn after a short delay, and other powerups still drop only from destroyed tanks.\nAdded some test launch pads in Desert and Snow.", "created_date": 1793315883, "id": "39708105852167216", "version": "1.2.1", "version_code": 25, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8747084702029403", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "40220826480895148"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2058879384501332"}]}, "change_log": "Fireballs damage tanks again. AI tanks are destroyed in one hit, and player tanks lose one health pip per hit (shields still block).\r\nFireballs still push the soccer balls around without exploding on them.\r\nAll levels are available from the start, with no qualifiers required.\r\nThe Shield, Speed Boost, Fast Gun and Health powerups can be picked up again.\r\nShooting a powerup or ammo crate destroys it. Ammo crates respawn after a short delay, and other powerups still drop only from destroyed tanks.", "created_date": 1792423566, "id": "39437479592563178", "version": "1.2.1", "version_code": 24, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBi